.TH PHANTASOS 1 "2026" "Livyatan Design Suite" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
phantasos \- image generation on your own iron
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B phantasos
.br
.B phantasos shape
\fI"prompt"\fR [\fIOUT.png\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-\-seed\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-size\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR \fIIMAGE\fR]
.br
.B phantasos models
.br
.B phantasos fetch
\fIMODEL\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bare invocation opens the window: type a prompt, press Create Image. Renders run
on a local stable-diffusion.cpp (Vulkan) backend \(em no cloud, no account.
The first render loads the model and takes minutes; after that the model
stays resident. Closing the window shuts the backend down and frees the GPU.
.PP
Models: \fBklein\fR (FLUX.2 klein 4B, the default \(em text-to-image and
reference edit in one 4-step model), \fBschnell\fR (FLUX.1 Schnell) and
\fBflux2dev\fR (FLUX.2 dev, non-commercial weights). No weights ship in the
package; \fBphantasos fetch\fR \fIMODEL\fR downloads a model's files from the
publisher into PHANTASOS_MODEL_DIR (resumable, size-verified) and
\fBphantasos models\fR lists sizes and what is installed. \fB\-\-size\fR sets the
square output edge for both width and height (default 1024, range
256\-4096); the window always renders 1024x1024. The Fetch button in
the window does the same for the selected model; the \fBWeights:\fR button
shows the folder in force and picks another (saved to
~/.config/phantasos/model_dir). With \fB\-\-from\fR (or Pick
image in the window) klein treats the image as a reference and the prompt as
the change; the other models redraw it as img2img at PHANTASOS_STRENGTH.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PHANTASOS_SD_DIR
Directory holding sd-server/sd-cli when not on PATH.
.TP
.B PHANTASOS_MODEL_DIR
Model weights. Overrides the folder picked with the Weights button
(~/.config/phantasos/model_dir). With neither set, the first run looks for
~/models/image or <mount>/models/image holding a known weight file and
remembers it; default ~/.local/share/phantasos/models. With no model
installed anywhere it looked, the window asks which models to download.
.TP
.B PHANTASOS_SD_SERVER
host:port of a running sd-server to render on instead of loading a model
here. Overrides the Server button (~/.config/phantasos/sd_server).
.TP
.B PHANTASOS_SAND_DUMP
Debug: a directory; the hourglass composite is written there as PNG every
30th frame while it runs.
.TP
.B DROP_QA
In-process QA script (drop-fyrox); inert when unset. Suppresses the
first-run download dialog.

.TP
.B PHANTASOS_OUT_DIR
Where new images land. Overrides the Folder button (~/.config/phantasos/out_dir);
default ~/Pictures.
.TP
.B PHANTASOS_SD_PORT
Loopback port the resident sd-server listens on (default 7860).
.TP
.B PHANTASOS_STRENGTH
img2img denoising strength for \fB\-\-from\fR on schnell/flux2dev
(default 0.6; klein's reference lane ignores it).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gilgamesh (1),
.BR kish (1),
.BR livyatan (7).
Setup (weights, GPU floor): /usr/share/doc/phantasos/README.md
